{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kinfolk is a completely serious peasant simulator where you can farm turnips, throw them at monks, and accidentally burn down the inn. Live your best (or worst) life as a medieval nobody who never trusts a stranger's soup. Milk cows, brew mead, commit light arson, and engage in deeply questionable roleplay with your equally clueless friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651240/extras/58753a75a0f6209bac268164ff754713.avif?t=1754969963\" width=678 height=202 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work your little pixel butt off to complete the day's goals before the sun sets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to burn your house down when you leave your cooking fire unattended.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can see it, you can do something with it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please don't throw the chickens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure that whatever you're eating isn't going to make you sick.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it's on fire, it's definitely hot and you probably shouldn't touch it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a lot of ways that you can get hurt, but it's pretty hard to die.\u00a0 Try not to lose your limbs and have to crawl back up a hill after a falling out with your bestie.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give yourself a makeover with the cool cosmetics that you can unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hang some memories on the wall as you unlock trophies for completing achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651240/extras/875d1fd0d6100bdeeb2bcccc667cfd07.avif?t=1754969963\" data-has-big width=800 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manifest your destiny at the expense of everyone else!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651240?t=1754969963","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651240?t=1754969963","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651240/a0182a956315772b3f4e5bcef29454b308d3c39a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754969963","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651240/a0182a956315772b3f4e5bcef29454b308d3c39a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754969963","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kinfolk is a completely serious peasant simulator where you can farm turnips, throw them at monks, and accidentally burn down the inn. Live your best (or worst) life as a medieval nobody who never trusts a stranger's soup. Milk cows, brew mead, commit light arson, and engage in deeply questionable roleplay with your equally clueless friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651240/extras/58753a75a0f6209bac268164ff754713.avif?t=1754969963\" width=678 height=202 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work your little pixel butt off to complete the day's goals before the sun sets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to burn your house down when you leave your cooking fire unattended.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can see it, you can do something with it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please don't throw the chickens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure that whatever you're eating isn't going to make you sick.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it's on fire, it's definitely hot and you probably shouldn't touch it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a lot of ways that you can get hurt, but it's pretty hard to die.\u00a0 Try not to lose your limbs and have to crawl back up a hill after a falling out with your bestie.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give yourself a makeover with the cool cosmetics that you can unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hang some memories on the wall as you unlock trophies for completing achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651240/extras/875d1fd0d6100bdeeb2bcccc667cfd07.avif?t=1754969963\" data-has-big width=800 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manifest your destiny at the expense of everyone else!</p>","developers":["Hearthside Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651240/f2e48eaca4a177b00c5c015e37f710ec1298d3df/header.jpg?t=1754969963","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3651240/896623693/15d340ac000cc85754ade015cb450a17d0d1d226/1752440706/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752464394","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3651240/896623693/15d340ac000cc85754ade015cb450a17d0d1d226/1752440706/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752464394","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3651240/896623693/15